                  "multiple": false,
                  "typeClass": "primitive",
                  "value": "This research aimed to create requirements for inclusive menstrual\r\ntechnologies, the RQ was “how can engaging with a transhumanist\r\nfuture yield requirements for current inclusive technologies that\r\nsupport menstruation?” Data was collected through a focus group\r\nwhere participants designed and then discussed transhumanist\r\nfuture menstrual technologies as cultural probes. Prior to the focus\r\ngroup, participants also filled in a sensitization task describing their\r\nmenstruation in the past, present, and future. All data is in Dutch."
                }
              }
